{"seq":2,"slug":"repair-workorder-scheduling-part-consumption","title":"维修工单排程与备件消耗联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/repair-workorder-scheduling-part-consumption","wordCount":2987,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"维修工单排程与备件消耗联动\">维修工单排程与备件消耗联动</h1><p>坏件进了维修中心，真正决定这套逆向网络是否赚钱的动作只有两个：给每个待修件排一个工单，以及为这个工单领出正确的备件。这两件事在组织里往往由两个人、两套系统、两本账管着——排程员用排程表排产，仓管用库存系统的领料单发货。于是出现一种典型事故：工位已备好、技师已到位、坏件已上架，但那个必须更换的板卡还躺在转运中的在途箱里，工单在&quot;待料&quot;状态挂三天，MTTR 被拉长，好件库又因提前预留被占用而无法出货。<strong>排程与备件消耗不是两个流程，而是同一个约束满足问题</strong>——工单的可行开工时间同时受限于工位、技师和备件的三重可用性。</p>\n<p>这篇文档处理三个问题：排程模型怎么把备件可用性纳入时间窗、备件消耗在系统里有哪几种记账路径、以及排程与库存脱节时会出现哪些可量化的故障模式。它建立在 <a href=\"../rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-intake-authorization-eligibility\">RMA 受理与授权资格判定模型</a> 判定出的处置类型之上——只有被判为&quot;维修&quot;的货才走这里的工单流程；消耗的备件来自 <a href=\"../spare-parts-network-layout/spare-sku-tiers-safety-stock\">备件 SKU 分层与安全库存设计</a> 定义的分层库存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个维修工单在系统里是一个<strong>资源预约</strong>，而非一张任务卡片。它的生命周期由三个时间戳界定：<strong>计划开工</strong>、<strong>实际开工</strong>、<strong>完工入库</strong>。计划开工到实际开工之间的差额就是&quot;等待&quot;，根因通常归到三类短缺之一：无工位、无技师、无备件。行业用<strong>一次修复率</strong>（First-Time-Fix, FTF）与<strong>平均修复时间</strong>（Mean Time To Repair, MTTR）衡量这套流程——现场服务软件把&quot;提高一次修复率&quot;列为移动化的首要收益，因为返修意味着二次排程、二次领料、二次物流（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Field_service_management\">Wikipedia: Field service management</a>）。</p>\n<p>MTTR 的定义是&quot;从故障发生到修复完成所需的平均时间&quot;，它天然包含等待备件的时间；与之配对的可用性由可靠性与可维修性共同决定（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_time_to_repair\">Wikipedia: Mean time to repair</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{MTBF}{MTBF + MTTR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条式子解释了为什么排程和备件必须联动：即使 MTBF 不变，只要备件等待把 MTTR 从 4 小时推到 36 小时，可用性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 就会断崖式下跌。管理层看到的&quot;维修效率下降&quot;往往不是技师慢，而是备件在错误的地点、以错误的数量、在错误的时刻出现。联动链路的结构如下。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[坏件收货并检测&lt;br/&gt;确定故障码+所需件] --&gt; B[工单创建&lt;br/&gt;带 BOM 需求行]&#10;    B --&gt; C{三重可用性检查}&#10;    C --&gt;|工位空闲?| D[工位日历]&#10;    C --&gt;|技师持证?| E[技能矩阵]&#10;    C --&gt;|备件可用?| F[库存可用量 ATP]&#10;    D --&gt; G[排程器求解&lt;br/&gt;最早可行开工时间]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt;|缺料| H[触发补货/跨仓调拨&lt;br/&gt;或改排其他工单]&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    G --&gt; I[下发工单&lt;br/&gt;生成领料预留]&#10;    I --&gt; J[技师开工&lt;br/&gt;按实际件领用/倒冲]&#10;    J --&gt; K[工单完工&lt;br/&gt;剩余预留释放回库]&#10;    K --&gt; L[坏件旧件回收&lt;br/&gt;判断可否再制造]\">graph TD\n    A[坏件收货并检测&lt;br/&gt;确定故障码+所需件] --&gt; B[工单创建&lt;br/&gt;带 BOM 需求行]\n    B --&gt; C{三重可用性检查}\n    C --&gt;|工位空闲?| D[工位日历]\n    C --&gt;|技师持证?| E[技能矩阵]\n    C --&gt;|备件可用?| F[库存可用量 ATP]\n    D --&gt; G[排程器求解&lt;br/&gt;最早可行开工时间]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt;|缺料| H[触发补货/跨仓调拨&lt;br/&gt;或改排其他工单]\n    H --&gt; F\n    G --&gt; I[下发工单&lt;br/&gt;生成领料预留]\n    I --&gt; J[技师开工&lt;br/&gt;按实际件领用/倒冲]\n    J --&gt; K[工单完工&lt;br/&gt;剩余预留释放回库]\n    K --&gt; L[坏件旧件回收&lt;br/&gt;判断可否再制造]</pre><p><strong>备件消耗的记账路径</strong>，是理解联动的关键。同一个物理备件从仓库到工位，在 ERP/EAM 系统里有不同的记账时点，选错了会导致账面与实物长期不符。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消耗路径</th>\n<th>触发时点</th>\n<th>账面生效</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预留/预订（Reservation）</td>\n<td>工单下发时</td>\n<td>仅锁可用量</td>\n<td>可预先知道用料</td>\n<td>长期未开工工单占用库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领用出库（Goods Issue）</td>\n<td>技师实际领件时</td>\n<td>立即减账面</td>\n<td>换件种类开工时才确定</td>\n<td>退料不及时产生账实差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倒冲（Backflush）</td>\n<td>工单完工确认时</td>\n<td>按 BOM 标准用量扣减</td>\n<td>用料标准化、消耗稳定</td>\n<td>与标准不符时偏差累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接核销（Direct Charge）</td>\n<td>开票/结算时</td>\n<td>计入工单成本</td>\n<td>低值易耗品、辅料</td>\n<td>无实物管控，易被挪用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 SAP 的 Plant Maintenance 语境里，这些动作对应不同物料移动类型（向工单发料 261、完工收货 101）；用错会让同一笔消耗既计入工单成本、又没从库存扣除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排程模型-工位-技师-备件三重约束\">排程模型：工位、技师、备件三重约束</h2><p>排程问题的经典形式是<strong>作业车间调度</strong>（Job Shop Scheduling）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个工件在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 台机器上按各自工序顺序加工，优化某个指标（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Job_shop_scheduling\">Wikipedia: Job shop scheduling</a>）。维修工单是它的特例，但多了两重约束：技师有技能、备件有库存上限。\n设工单集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>、工位集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、技师集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，工单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的最早可行开工时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须同时满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>ready</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>slot</mtext><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>tech</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>part</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_j \\ge \\max\\bigl(\\text{ready}_j,\\ \\text{slot}_m,\\ \\text{tech}_w,\\ \\text{part}_j\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ready</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slot</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tech</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">part</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ready</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ready}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ready</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是坏件检测完成时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>slot</mtext><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{slot}_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slot</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是所需工位的下一个空档，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>tech</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{tech}_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tech</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是持证技师的下一个可用时段，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>part</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{part}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9953em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">part</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是所需备料的可用时间（现货为 0，缺料则为预计到货或跨仓调拨到货时间）。排程器在派单顺序上通常用<strong>分派规则</strong>（dispatch rule）而非全局最优，因为全局求解在工单量大时不实时。常见几条及其权衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPT（最短加工时间优先）</strong>：工单平均流转时间最短，但会饿死长工单。</li>\n<li><strong>EDD（最早交付期优先）</strong>：按客户承诺交付期排序，适合对 SLA 敏感的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>WSPT（加权最短加工时间，即 Smith 规则）</strong>：按&quot;权重/加工时间&quot;降序，权重可为客户等级或保内/保外优先级，理论上最小化加权总完工时间。</li>\n<li><strong>关键比（Critical Ratio）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>剩余交付时间</mtext><mtext>剩余工作量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CR} = \\frac{\\text{剩余交付时间}}{\\text{剩余工作量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">剩余工作量</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">剩余交付时间</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，CR 小于 1 的工单必须插队。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在跨境电商的逆向网络里，权重几乎总是<strong>双轨的</strong>：保内维修（卖家承担成本、有法定时限）权重高于保外付费维修（买家承担、时限宽松）。让保外工单为保内工单让位符合成本逻辑，因为逾期保内维修在欧盟会触发法定的救济升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"备件消耗与库存的联动机制\">备件消耗与库存的联动机制</h2><p>联动机制的核心是一张<strong>可用量（Available-to-Promise, ATP）<strong>视图。库存系统里同一个 SKU 有两个数字容易被混为一谈：<strong>在手量</strong>与</strong>可用量</strong>（可用量 = 在手量 − 已预留 − 安全库存 − 质检冻结）。排程器必须读可用量而非在手量，否则那些已被其他工单预留、或已划为安全库存的件会被重复承诺，形成&quot;账面有货、实际无货&quot;的缺口。</p>\n<p>联动有三条落地规则：</p>\n<p><strong>规则一：先预留、后开工。</strong> 工单确认排程后立刻对所需备料生成预留（reservation），把该件从&quot;可用&quot;转为&quot;锁定&quot;。若预留对应在途库存，则同时生成<strong>物料可用性日期</strong>（预计到货日），排程器据此向后推工单。</p>\n<p><strong>规则二：消耗时点与工单状态绑定。</strong> 领用出库发生在技师扫码取件时，倒冲发生在工单完工确认时，两条路径不能混用——既预留又在完工时倒冲会造成重复扣减。标准化换件（屏幕、电池）用倒冲提效，非标件（需诊断后才定型号的主板）用领用出库保准确。</p>\n<p><strong>规则三：退料与串料要闭环。</strong> 技师领了件但没用上、或领错型号，必须走退料或串料（转给另一工单），否则领用出库扣减的账面永远不会回来，这是账实差异的最大来源。</p>\n<p>三条规则合起来形成&quot;预留—消耗—结清&quot;闭环：工单完工时若有未消耗的预留，系统必须自动释放回可用池。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键指标与联动效果度量\">关键指标与联动效果度量</h2><p>联动做得好不好，不能靠&quot;感觉仓库不缺料&quot;，要靠能拆出根因的指标。下表把每个指标对应到它暴露的联动缺陷。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>暴露的缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>备件等待时间占比</td>\n<td>工单等待时长中因缺料造成的比例</td>\n<td>排程未读 ATP，或安全库存设错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工单一次修复率（FTF）</td>\n<td>首次维修即修复、无需返工的比例</td>\n<td>BOM 不准、诊断不足、串料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预留周转率</td>\n<td>预留被消耗或释放的平均天数</td>\n<td>长期挂账工单占用库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账实差异率</td>\n<td>盘点差异 / 账面库存</td>\n<td>领退料失控、倒冲偏差累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTTR</td>\n<td>平均修复时间（含等待）</td>\n<td>综合表现，被前三项共同驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>FTF 是最被低估的联动指标</strong>。一次修复失败的工单会重新进入排程队列，等于把同一个坏件做两遍——两遍工位占用、两遍技师工时、两遍备件消耗，第二次往往还消耗更多件（因为第一次误判了故障）。它的直接决定因素之一就是&quot;工单开工时备件是否齐套&quot;。</p>\n<p>另一个必须纳入联动的度量是<strong>旧件回收率</strong>。维修换下的旧件（core）若能进入再制造或翻新流程，其价值可冲抵新件成本——这正是逆向物流的商业逻辑：退货商品可以进入&quot;第二次生命周期&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Return_merchandise_authorization\">Wikipedia: Return merchandise authorization</a>）。若工单完工时不强制登记旧件回收，旧件就会在技师手上流失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联动失效的反模式与治理\">联动失效的反模式与治理</h2><p><strong>反模式一：排程与库存读两个数据源。</strong> 排程系统与库存系统各维护一份&quot;可用量&quot;，靠夜间批处理同步，白天排程看到的是昨天的数字。治理方式是让排程器实时查询 ATP 接口，而不是复制快照。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式二：把缺料当成排程的&quot;外部输入&quot;。</strong> 排程器只按工位和技师排，缺料工单照常下发，开工时才发现无件。治理方式是让缺料成为一等约束——缺料工单的开工时间直接由备料到货时间决定。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式三：安全库存一刀切。</strong> 所有备件用同一系数，导致高值低频件过度占用资金、高频易损件反而断料。正确做法是按 SKU 分层，见 <a href=\"../spare-parts-network-layout/spare-sku-tiers-safety-stock\">备件 SKU 分层与安全库存设计</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>反模式四：KPI 互相打架。</strong> 仓库的 KPI 是库存周转率和账实一致率（倾向少备、晚发），维修的 KPI 是 FTF 和 MTTR（倾向多备、早发），各自最优时全局最差。治理方式是设立跨部门的联合指标，如&quot;含备件等待的端到端 MTTR&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>治理的落地前提是法规时间表。</strong> 2026 年前后多国推进&quot;维修权&quot;立法，要求厂商提供备件与维修信息的可及性——欧盟《促进商品维修指令》(EU) 2024/1799 已于 2024 年通过，成员国须在 2026 年 7 月底前完成国内法转化（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2024/1799/oj\">EUR-Lex: Directive (EU) 2024/1799</a>）。备件可得性从运营选择变成法律义务，联动失效不止是成本问题。资产管理与维修体系的通用框架可参考 ISO 55000 系列资产管理标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>排程与备件消耗是同一个约束满足问题的两面：工单最早可行开工时间由工位、技师、备件三者可用性的最大值决定。</li>\n<li>备件消耗有预留、领用、倒冲、直接核销四条记账路径，选错会造成账实不符或重复扣减；标准件适合倒冲，非标件适合领用出库。</li>\n<li>排程器必须读可用量 ATP 而非在手量，并遵循&quot;先预留、后开工&quot;。</li>\n<li>预留—消耗—结清必须闭环；未消耗的预留要在完工时释放，退料/串料要及时回冲。</li>\n<li>关键度量是备件等待占比、FTF、预留周转率、账实差异率与 MTTR，其中 FTF 是总维修成本最灵敏的前置指标。</li>\n<li>四种反模式是双数据源、缺料外置、安全库存一刀切、KPI 打架；治理的根本是跨部门的端到端指标。</li>\n<li>2026 年多国维修权立法（如欧盟 2024/1799 指令的转化期限）把备件可得性从运营优化提升为法律义务。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维修工单排程与备件消耗联动","id":"维修工单排程与备件消耗联动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排程模型：工位、技师、备件三重约束","id":"排程模型-工位-技师-备件三重约束"},{"level":2,"text":"备件消耗与库存的联动机制","id":"备件消耗与库存的联动机制"},{"level":2,"text":"关键指标与联动效果度量","id":"关键指标与联动效果度量"},{"level":2,"text":"联动失效的反模式与治理","id":"联动失效的反模式与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"坏件分级判定与维修报废决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/defect-grading-repair-scrap-decision"},"next":{"title":"翻新件合规标识与退运清关处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/refurbished-part-compliance-reverse-clearance"}}